.SH "Deno"
.PP
As of v3\&.1\&.0, \fRescalade\fP is available on the Deno registry\&.

.PP
Please note that the \fBAPI\fP is identical and that there are still \fBtwo modes\fP from which to choose:

.PP
.PP
.nf
// Choose "async" mode
import escalade from 'https://deno\&.land/escalade/async\&.ts';

// Choose "sync" mode
import escalade from 'https://deno\&.land/escalade/sync\&.ts';
.fi
.PP

.PP
.RS 4
\fBImportant:\fP The \fRallow-read\fP permission is required! 
.RE
.PP
